# This folder is published as a public website (royaldiamondnails.com), so
# anything committed here can be downloaded by anyone who knows the file name.

# The WhatsApp reminder program lives OUTSIDE this folder, at
# C:\RoyalDiamond\reminders, because it holds client phone numbers, the record of
# who has been messaged, and the WhatsApp access token. This line is a guard: if a
# copy ever ends up back in here, git will refuse to publish it.
/reminders/

# Diary exports — real client names and phone numbers.
royaldiamond-backup*.json

# Wrangler's working folder, written next to the Worker every time it deploys.
# It caches the Cloudflare account id and name, which have no business on a
# public website. The Worker's own secrets are never here — they are held by
# Cloudflare and cannot be read back out — but this folder still stays private.
/worker/.wrangler/
node_modules/
